<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-3">Vehicle Fleet Management</h1>
        <p class="lead mb-4">
            Maximize asset longevity and operational uptime through structured fleet stewardship, 
            preventative maintenance, and rigorous cost tracking.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Asset Registry & Lifecycle Tracking</h2>
        <p>
            Build a definitive digital register of every vehicle in your fleet, capturing 
            make, model, VIN, and engine specifications. The system tracks the full 
            history of each asset—from acquisition and daily driver assignments to 
            long-term maintenance interventions and eventual disposal. This lifecycle 
            view provides the total cost of ownership (TCO) data needed for strategic 
            fleet replacement planning.
        </p>
        <p>
            Automated alerts for license renewals, fitness certificates, and insurance 
            re-valuations ensure that your fleet remains legally compliant and 
            fully protected at all times.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Preventative Maintenance & Inspection</h2>
        <p>
            Eliminate reactive repairs with a proactive maintenance engine. Pre-configure service 
            intervals for every vehicle category and let the system trigger maintenance tasks 
            based on actual mileage or time elapsed. Digital pre-trip inspection checklists 
            via the driver app ensure that minor issues—such as tire wear or fluid levels—are 
            identified and resolved before they lead to expensive roadside breakdowns 
             or safety incidents.
        </p>
        <p>
            Integration with the warehouse module ensures that vehicle spare parts are tracked 
            and costed correctly against each asset, providing clear visibility into 
            maintenance spend by vehicle and fleet class.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Fuel & Utilization Efficiency</h2>
        <p>
            Monitor the primary driver of logistics costs: fuel. The system correlates fuel 
            purchases (fill-ups) against distance traveled, identifying vehicles with 
            abnormal consumption patterns that may indicate mechanical issues or fuel 
            theft. Detailed utilization reporting identifies frequently idle vehicles, allowing 
            managers to adjust fleet size or redeploy assets to high-demand routes.
        </p>
        <p>
            Real-time odometer tracking—synced from the driver terminal—underpins all cost-per-KM 
            analytics, providing an authoritative baseline for organizational efficiency 
            benchmarking.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

